  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gaza Health Recovery Activity (GHRA)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the Gaza Health Recovery Activity is to improve health outcomes for Gazans through the restoration of NGO health services across the Gaza Strip. To address the complex health needs of Gazans post-conflict, this activity will not only focus on restoring services at the primary health care level, but also will provide limited support to secondary health care services and facilities as determined by the rapid needs assessment</narrative>
  </description>
